# Klipy: no key in the sandbox.
ipc panels open emoji TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ptr move 1141 398 sleep 300 click
wait 1
shot nokey
note GIF tab without a key: "Add a KLIPY key to use GIFs" with buttons "Open Settings" and "Get a key" centred under the text; same as QML.
# MANUAL: with a key and network: GIF tab -> "Loading trending GIFs..." then a 3-column grid; type cat -> after 350 ms "Searching GIFs..." then results; scroll to the end -> spinner and next page appends without jumps
# MANUAL: change emoji.klipyKey in the config while the GIF tab is open -> grid clears and reloads (bad key: "KLIPY didn't accept the key")
key -k Escape
